  "id": "BIT-grafana-2026-100105",
  "summary": "Alerting contact point authorization bypass via schema downgrade",
  "details": "A user with permission to edit contact points but not their protected fields can change protected settings, such as a contact point's destination URL, by switching an integration to a legacy schema version, which can expose stored credentials and redirect alert notifications (incorrect authorization).",
